menu "PlantHub RTC"

config PLANTHUB_RTC_DS3231
    bool "Enable the optional DS3231 I2C RTC"
    default n
    help
        Read a DS3231 real-time clock over I2C (SDA=GPIO6, SCL=GPIO7, addr
        0x68) at boot to seed the hub's wall clock before WiFi/SNTP, and keep
        it trained from SNTP / browser time-sets. Absent-tolerant: with no
        module fitted the hub falls back to SNTP exactly as before. See
        docs/esplayout/h2-link-wiring.md.

endmenu
